IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. F04-APPEND-AUDIT-LOG.
*> Appends a new transaction entry using OPEN EXTEND.
*> SELECT OPTIONAL lets it create the log if missing (status 05).

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT OPTIONAL DAILY-AUDIT-LOG ASSIGN TO "audit.log"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
        ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-AUD-STATUS.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  DAILY-AUDIT-LOG.
01  AUDIT-REC           PIC X(60).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-AUD-STATUS       PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
01  WS-NEW-ENTRY        PIC X(60).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-NEW-ENTRY

    OPEN EXTEND DAILY-AUDIT-LOG
    IF WS-AUD-STATUS = "00" OR WS-AUD-STATUS = "05"
        WRITE AUDIT-REC FROM WS-NEW-ENTRY
        CLOSE DAILY-AUDIT-LOG
        DISPLAY "AUDIT RECORD APPENDED"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "OPEN EXTEND FAILED: " WS-AUD-STATUS
        MOVE 16 TO RETURN-CODE
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
